  "description": "City-by-city data on whether Google AI Mode names a local business when asked a buying question, paired with a same-day homepage technology and content crawl, across six industries: med spas, roofers, dentists, personal injury law firms, chiropractors and HVAC contractors. September 2026 edition. <p>Canonical reports and method: <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research\">https://www.kkvlabs.com/research</a>. Flagship summary: <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/ai-local-visibility-report-2026\">AI Local Visibility Report 2026</a>. Per-industry reports: <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/med-spa-ai-visibility-index-2026\">med spas</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/roofing-ai-visibility-index-2026\">roofers</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/dental-ai-visibility-index-2026\">dentists</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/law-firm-ai-visibility-index-2026\">personal injury law firms</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/chiropractic-ai-visibility-index-2026\">chiropractors</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kkvlabs.com/research/hvac-ai-visibility-index-2026\">HVAC contractors</a>. Source code for the export: <a href=\"https://github.com/karthikvarma91/kkvlabs-research-data\">github.com/karthikvarma91/kkvlabs-research-data</a>. Published by KKV Labs LLC, Newark, Delaware.</p>",
